 I told him that we would get together one afternoon and go through some playlists. He loved the idea!\n But I am intimidated too, because we are paying for a DJ but I want to make sure he has songs that I want\/like.","Attachments":[],"Id":702832,"PostDate":1243363580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah, good thread! Thanks!<br \/> My Dad is a DJ for a radio station here, so I told him that we would get together one afternoon and go through some playlists. He loved the idea!<br \/> But I am intimidated too, because we are paying for a DJ but I want to make sure he has songs that I want\/like.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~jill~<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091204\/e\/til%27+I+become+a+Mrs%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/56d6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...56d6\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/j-mwedding-jill-s-planning-thread-52155\/index2.html#post1073482\">My Planning Thread<\/a><span>40 people booked plus bride & groom<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jillianbeth34@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1222738424,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212041.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J&MWedding","Id":212041,"Name":"J&MWedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edb416c59b81b2a5f106506f8ff3782f","RawContent":"I&#039;m still working on my dinner music, but here is my reception music. It is exactly 3 hours long:\n \n You Are The Best Thing, Ray LaMontague\n Somewhere Over The Rainbow\n Shout (Parts 1 and 2, The Isley Brothers\n Celebration, Kool And The Gang\n Hey Ya, Outkast\n Just Dance, Lady GaGa &amp;amp; Colby O&#039;Donis\n Jump Jive An&#039; Wail, The Brian Setzer Orchestra&amp;lt;\/string&amp;gt;\n Tequila, The Champs\n Boot Scootin&#039; Boogie, Brooks &amp;amp; Dunn\n Unforgettable, Nat King Cole &amp;amp; Natalie Cole\n I Got You (I Feel Good), James Brown\n How Sweet It Is (To Be Loved By You), James Taylor\n Cha Cha Slide, Casper\n Don&#039;t Stop Believin&#039;, Journey\n Mony Mony, Billy Idol\n Conga, Gloria Estefan\n Friends In Low Places, Garth Brooks\n At Last (Single), Etta James\n Single Ladies (Put a Ring On It), Beyonc\u00a9\n 4 Minutes (feat. Justin Timberlake &amp;amp; Timbaland, Madonna\n I Like to Move It, Crazy Frog\n Hot Hot Hot, Buster Poindexter &amp;amp; His Banshees Of Blue\n Only You (And You Alone), The Platters\n What If I Loved You, Joey Gian\n Footloose, Kenny Loggins\n Love Shack, The B-52&#039;s\n Cupid Shuffle, Cupid\n Gonna Make You Sweat (Everybody Dance Now, C+C Music Factory (Presenting Freedom Williams)\n Girls Just Want to Have Fun, Cyndi Lauper\n Pour Some Sugar On Me, Def Leopard\n Squeeze Me, Kraak &amp;amp; Smaak\n Crazy Little Thing Called Love, Michael Bubl\u00a9\n You Are So Beautiful, Joe Cocker\n Sweet Caroline, Neil Diamond\n I Can&#039;t Help Myself (Sugar Pie, Honey Bunch, Four Tops\n I Want You Back, Jackson 5\n Land Of A Thousand Dances, The Commitments\n Superstition, Stevie Wonder","Attachments":[],"Id":703082,"PostDate":1243374272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm still working on my dinner music, but here is my reception music. It is exactly 3 hours long:<br \/> <br \/> You Are The Best Thing, Ray LaMontague<br \/> Somewhere Over The Rainbow<br \/> Shout (Parts 1 and 2, The Isley Brothers<br \/> Celebration, Kool And The Gang<br \/> Hey Ya, Outkast<br \/> Just Dance, Lady GaGa & Colby O'Donis<br \/> Jump Jive An' Wail, The Brian Setzer Orchestra<\/string><br \/> Tequila, The Champs<br \/> Boot Scootin' Boogie, Brooks & Dunn<br \/> Unforgettable, Nat King Cole & Natalie Cole<br \/> I Got You (I Feel Good), James Brown<br \/> How Sweet It Is (To Be Loved By You), James Taylor<br \/> Cha Cha Slide, Casper<br \/> Don't Stop Believin', Journey<br \/> Mony Mony, Billy Idol<br \/> Conga, Gloria Estefan<br \/> Friends In Low Places, Garth Brooks<br \/> At Last (Single), Etta James<br \/> Single Ladies (Put a Ring On It), Beyonc\u00a9<br \/> 4 Minutes (feat. Justin Timberlake & Timbaland, Madonna<br \/> I Like to Move It, Crazy Frog<br \/> Hot Hot Hot, Buster Poindexter & His Banshees Of Blue<br \/> Only You (And You Alone), The Platters<br \/> What If I Loved You, Joey Gian<br \/> Footloose, Kenny Loggins<br \/> Love Shack, The B-52's<br \/> Cupid Shuffle, Cupid<br \/> Gonna Make You Sweat (Everybody Dance Now, C+C Music Factory (Presenting Freedom Williams)<br \/> Girls Just Want to Have Fun, Cyndi Lauper<br \/> Pour Some Sugar On Me, Def Leopard<br \/> Squeeze Me, Kraak & Smaak<br \/> Crazy Little Thing Called Love, Michael Bubl\u00a9<br \/> You Are So Beautiful, Joe Cocker<br \/> Sweet Caroline, Neil Diamond<br \/> I Can't Help Myself (Sugar Pie, Honey Bunch, Four Tops<br \/> I Want You Back, Jackson 5<br \/> Land Of A Thousand Dances, The Commitments<br \/> Superstition, Stevie Wonder\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/xDfPm8\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/xDfPm8\/.png<\/a><br><br><strong>68 Confirmed Guests!!<\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bls64.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...nde2\/bls64.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bandy.bo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1212517719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209736.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":65,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Goldstein to Be","Id":209736,"Name":"Goldstein to Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98f85b7609580644403e387bd7a060b1","RawContent":"thanks for the posts ladies, this is so helpful. I will be sure to post mine when I am done...but I still have 6 months until my wedding so I will just be downloading away :)","Attachments":[],"Id":703302,"PostDate":1243386472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n            