{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7d9feb1ac28f91e0a2c090d1c326503","RawContent":"i worked crazy hard on mine just to have people pulling my ipod off the dock and replacing it with theirs for certain songs they wanted to hear. the result was me not ever getting to the later songs in the playlist (some of the best stuff, since as you know, you arrange them to build up as the night goes on), and obviously the transition from one ipod to another wasn&#039;t smooth at all. honestly it&#039;s my only complaint from my entire wedding experience. i should NOT have allowed it to happen ... don&#039;t let it happen to you! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":708843,"PostDate":1243881815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i worked crazy hard on mine just to have people pulling my ipod off the dock and replacing it with theirs for certain songs they wanted to hear. the result was me not ever getting to the later songs in the playlist (some of the best stuff, since as you know, you arrange them to build up as the night goes on), and obviously the transition from one ipod to another wasn't smooth at all. honestly it's my only complaint from my entire wedding experience. i should NOT have allowed it to happen ... don't let it happen to you! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207092360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"691652605882fca8f5f7a74a5175c316","RawContent":"Oh I&#039;m too big of a bitch and people know better!","Attachments":[],"Id":709098,"PostDate":1243896600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh I'm too big of a bitch and people know better!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3185003ca60fef56d8cb59d2c5c2e0d8","RawContent":"Hahaha, just give them that &amp;quot;don&#039;t you DARE&amp;quot; look","Attachments":[],"Id":709136,"PostDate":1243900374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hahaha, just give them that \"don't you DARE\" look\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~Joanna~<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20090627\/e\/Our+Wedding%21\/k\/674b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...674b\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"JoLo908@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1196878363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoLo908","Id":208008,"Name":"JoLo908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0826fd1b0b615696ce6f43f512e64b2e","RawContent":"Perfect timing for me...I&#039;ll add some of these to mine as well. I have a &amp;quot;no play&amp;quot; list too. No one else is doing that?","Attachments":[],"Id":709378,"PostDate":1243914362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Perfect timing for me...I'll add some of these to mine as well. I have a \"no play\" list too. No one else is doing that?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"debbi@jhu.edu","IpAddress":"162.129.251.65","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1241552427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217307.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Debbi803","Id":217307,"Name":"Debbi803","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"594314a92efe2c3bf6e4c61aeb35c94a","RawContent":"I&#039;m just using my iPod so I don&#039;t need a no play list.","Attachments":[],"Id":709397,"PostDate":1243915228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm just using my iPod so I don't need a no play list.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d14982690f11f25a34ad40ef533dabb8","RawContent":"Jacilynda I&#039;m the same as you! I will shoot devil eyes at anyone who even comes NEAR the iPod!","Attachments":[],"Id":709564,"PostDate":1243949525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jacilynda I'm the same as you! I will shoot devil eyes at anyone who even comes NEAR the iPod!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heath4@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.195.245.137","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1211828100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209589.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Heather*","Id":209589,"Name":"*Heather*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bad0f0c830a8df42c953711cc00e848","RawContent":"glad you ladies can learn from my mistake! it&#039;s my one real wedding regret. i actually started sorta yelling at DH ... not really mean-like, but it probably still looked pretty bad because i&#039;m sure i was clearly upset. my friend made a comment like, &amp;quot;awww their first married argument&amp;quot; so i guess i did make a bit of a scene.\n \n before the ipod got changed tho, i was getting a ton of compliments on the music choices. so dinner music was good at least, lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":709617,"PostDate":1243952450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                glad you ladies can learn from my mistake! it's my one real wedding regret. i actually started sorta yelling at DH ... not really mean-like, but it probably still looked pretty bad because i'm sure i was clearly upset. my friend made a comment like, \"awww their first married argument\" so i guess i did make a bit of a scene.<br \/> <br \/> before the ipod got changed tho, i was getting a ton of compliments on the music choices. so dinner music was good at least, lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207092360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f46324ca6c1403343d975f2587bce8e9","RawContent":"figured i&#039;d post mine despite the fact that it got all screwed up:\n \n &lt;strong&gt;CEREMONY&lt;\/strong&gt;\n prelude: nothing else matters - apocalyptica (cover of metallica)\n bridesmaids&#039; processional: just like heaven - string quartet tribute to the cure\n bridal processional: canon in D - t. carter music, highland serenade\n recessional: for once in my life - stevie wonder\n \n &lt;strong&gt;COCKTAIL HOUR&lt;\/strong&gt;\n performance by mariachi trio provided by resort\n \n &lt;strong&gt;RECEPTION&lt;\/strong&gt;\n first dance: love you till the end - the pogues\n father\/daughter: i loved her first - heartland\n mother\/son: thank you for loving me - bon jovi\n \n &lt;strong&gt;dinner:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n somewhere over the rainbow\/what a wonderful world - israel kamakawiwo&#039;ole\n everlong (acoustic) - foo fighters\n every little thing she does is magic - the police\n use somebody - kings of leon\n better together - jack johnson\n brighter than sunshine - aqualung\n do ya, do ya want my love - ELO (electric light orchestra)\n fly me to the moon - frank sinatra\n desperado theme\/el mariachi - gypsy kings\n i would walk 500 miles - the proclaimers\n faithfully - journey\n crazy little thing called love - queen\n 1,2,3,4 - plain white Ts\n i&#039;m yours - jason mraz\n waterslide - the bonedaddys\n come on eileen - dexy&#039;s midnight runners\n brown eyed girl - van morrison\n margaritaville - jimmy buffet\n sweet caroline - neil diamond\n \n &lt;strong&gt;dancing&lt;\/strong&gt;\n love shack - B-52s\n jump, jive an&#039; wail - louis prima\n great balls of fire - jerry lee lewis\n safety dance - men without hats\n la bamba - richie valens\n cotton eye joe - rednex\n groove is in the heart - deee lite\n copacabana - barry manilow\n you spin me right round - dead or alive\n baby got back - sir mix a lot\n hey ya - outkast\n mambo number five - lou bega\n heaven must me missing an angel - tavares\n hey mickey - toni basil\n i&#039;m a believer - smashmouth\n what i like about you - the kinks\n you shook me all night long - ACDC\n hey baby (if you&#039;ll be my girl) - dj otzi\n tempature - sean paul\n shout - the isley brothers\n paradise by dashboard lights - meatloaf\n girls just wanna have fun - cyndi lauper\n jump in the line - harry belafonte\n fergalicious - fergie\n it takes two - rob base &amp;amp; dj ez rock\n humpty dance - digital underground\n push it - salt n&#039; pepa\n my humps - black eyed peas\n apache - sugarhill gang\n ymca - village people\n i like it like that - tito nieves\n tequila - richie valens\n \n &amp;quot;i&#039;m a believer&amp;quot; got skipped, and &amp;quot;what i like about you&amp;quot; got cut off halfway, and we never got any further in my playlist.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/censored.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Censored\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; i also had &amp;quot;pour some sugar on me&amp;quot; in there for the cake, but since my ipod was not to be found at the time we had absolutely nothing playing for that. we did throw in a few slow songs too ... i think &amp;quot;baby i love your way&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;come fly with me.&amp;quot;","Attachments":[],"Id":711563,"PostDate":1244071154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                figured i'd post mine despite the fact that it got all screwed up:<br \/> <br \/> <strong>CEREMONY<\/strong><br \/> prelude: nothing else matters - apocalyptica (cover of metallica)<br \/> bridesmaids' processional: just like heaven - string quartet tribute to the cure<br \/> bridal processional: canon in D - t. carter music, highland serenade<br \/> recessional: for once in my life - stevie wonder<br \/> <br \/> <strong>COCKTAIL HOUR<\/strong><br \/> performance by mariachi trio provided by resort<br \/> <br \/> <strong>RECEPTION<\/strong><br \/> first dance: love you till the end - the pogues<br \/> father\/daughter: i loved her first - heartland<br \/> mother\/son: thank you for loving me - bon jovi<br \/> <br \/> <strong>dinner:<\/strong><br \/> somewhere over the rainbow\/what a wonderful world - israel kamakawiwo'ole<br \/> everlong (acoustic) - foo fighters<br \/> every little thing she does is magic - the police<br \/> use somebody - kings of leon<br \/> better together - jack johnson<br \/> brighter than sunshine - aqualung<br \/> do ya, do ya want my love - ELO (electric light orchestra)<br \/> fly me to the moon - frank sinatra<br \/> desperado theme\/el mariachi - gypsy kings<br \/> i would walk 500 miles - the proclaimers<br \/> faithfully - journey<br \/> crazy little thing called love - queen<br \/> 1,2,3,4 - plain white Ts<br \/> i'm yours - jason mraz<br \/> waterslide - the bonedaddys<br \/> come on eileen - dexy's midnight runners<br \/> brown eyed girl - van morrison<br \/> margaritaville - jimmy buffet<br \/> sweet caroline - neil diamond<br \/> <br \/> <strong>dancing<\/strong><br \/> love shack - B-52s<br \/> jump, jive an' wail - louis prima<br \/> great balls of fire - jerry lee lewis<br \/> safety dance - men without hats<br \/> la bamba - richie valens<br \/> cotton eye joe - rednex<br \/> groove is in the heart - deee lite<br \/> copacabana - barry manilow<br \/> you spin me right round - dead or alive<br \/> baby got back - sir mix a lot<br \/> hey ya - outkast<br \/> mambo number five - lou bega<br \/> heaven must me missing an angel - tavares<br \/> hey mickey - toni basil<br \/> i'm a believer - smashmouth<br \/> what i like about you - the kinks<br \/> you shook me all night long - ACDC<br \/> hey baby (if you'll be my girl) - dj otzi<br \/> tempature - sean paul<br \/> shout - the isley brothers<br \/> paradise by dashboard lights - meatloaf<br \/> girls just wanna have fun - cyndi lauper<br \/> jump in the line - harry belafonte<br \/> fergalicious - fergie<br \/> it takes two - rob base & dj ez rock<br \/> humpty dance - digital underground<br \/> push it - salt n' pepa<br \/> my humps - black eyed peas<br \/> apache - sugarhill gang<br \/> ymca - village people<br \/> i like it like that - tito nieves<br \/> tequila - richie valens<br \/> <br \/> \"i'm a believer\" got skipped, and \"what i like about you\" got cut off halfway, and we never got any further in my playlist.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/censored.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Censored\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> i also had \"pour some sugar on me\" in there for the cake, but since my ipod was not to be found at the time we had absolutely nothing playing for that. we did throw in a few slow songs too ... i think \"baby i love your way\" and \"come fly with me.\"\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207092360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0848a719a124f55257fe03425291552d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Debbi803&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Perfect timing for me...I&#039;ll add some of these to mine as well. I have a &amp;quot;no play&amp;quot; list too. No one else is doing that?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have started on my DO NOT Playlist!! There are soooo many. Mostly the songs I hear at every wedding when everyone is drunk and doesn&#039;t care what they(we) are dancing to.","Attachments":[],"Id":711945,"PostDate":1244094962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Debbi803<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Perfect timing for me...I'll add some of these to mine as well. I have a \"no play\" list too. No one else is doing that?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I have started on my DO NOT Playlist!! There are soooo many. Mostly the songs I hear at every wedding when everyone is drunk and doesn't care what they(we) are dancing to.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/th6fm7\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/th6fm7\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lupearroyo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1228809329,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213086.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":72,"PhotoHeight":96,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lupearroyo","Id":213086,"Name":"lupearroyo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35820,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f86b0d9323d204f6ced0ea4944108791","RawContent":"FYI- to create a smooth transition between your songs on itunes so it sounds more like a real DJ- go under Edit- preferences- playback- crossfade. You can adjust the fade. It works well!","Attachments":[],"Id":714843,"PostDate":1244341480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                FYI- to create a smooth transition between your songs on itunes so it sounds more like a real DJ- go under Edit- preferences- playback- crossfade. You can adjust the fade. It works well!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/cancunphotos.bigfolioblog.com\/\">http:\/\/cancunphotos.bigfolioblog.com\/<\/a><br><span>Photo by Sascha Gluck from Cancun Photos<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akwestfall@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1203187579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208561.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akbeach","Id":208561,"Name":"akbeach","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":333,"TotalPages":34,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":330},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
