c\u201c Israel Kamakawiwo\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ole\n Linus and Lucy \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Schroeder\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Greatest Hits\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Dinner&lt;\/strong&gt;\n Island in the Sun \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Weezer (introduce wedding party)\n Champagne Supernova \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Oasis\n Come Rain or Come Shine \u00e2\u20ac\u201c BB King and Eric Clapton\n All Is Full of Love \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Bjork\n Little Wing \u00e2\u20ac\u201c The Jimi Hendrix Experience\n Wild Horses \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Rolling Stones\n Kokomo \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Beach Boys\n The Perfect Girl \u00e2\u20ac\u201c The Cure\n Learning To Fly \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tom Petty &amp;amp; The Heartbreakers\n Throne of Gold \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Steel Pulse\n Glory Box \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Portishead\n Glycerine \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Bush\n Stuck in A Moment You Can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t Get Out Of \u00e2\u20ac\u201c U2\n Summertime \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Janis Joplin\n Tiny Dancer \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Elton John\n Tonight \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Smashing Pumpkins\n Love Song \u00e2\u20ac\u201c The Cure\n Hymn 43 \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jethro Tull\n And I Love Her \u00e2\u20ac\u201c The Beatles\n Piano Man \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Billy Joel\n Only in Dreams \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Weezer\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Reception&lt;\/strong&gt;\n I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m Yours \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Jason Mraz (first dance)\n Scarlet Ribbons \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Roisin Murphy (father\/daughter)\n Teach Your Children (mother\/son)\n Just Dance \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Lady Gaga\n White Wedding \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Billy Joel\n That Was A Crazy Game of Poker \u00e2\u20ac\u201c OAR\n Underneath It All \u00e2\u20ac\u201c No Doubt\n Lay Lady Lay \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Bob Dylan\n Steppin\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 Out \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Steel Pulse\n Come on Eileen \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Dexy\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Midnight Runners\n Rock the Casbah \u00e2\u20ac\u201c The Clash\n The Sweet Escape \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Gwen Stefani\n Temperature \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Sean Paul\n Stuck In the Middle With Yo