t;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re trying to cut costs anywhere we can and my fianc\u00e9 is really excited about the idea of making his own playlists.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!! xo&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900663,"PostDate":1437149530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can anyone recommend a really good DJ app (iPhone\/iPod) they may have used recently?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're trying to cut costs anywhere we can and my fianc\u00e9 is really excited about the idea of making his own playlists.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!! xo<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1438177324","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 17 July 2015 - 04:36 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1437151008,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7d306069b19a4e5581733573af1f2ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Skim thru here, it was a recent one where they are talking about apps and such!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also believe @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] spoke about her experiencing making playlists too - I think it was in her planning thread, but if not hopefully she can pop on here and tell you where to find that info. &amp;nbsp; Not sure if she used this app or not, but she is using an app of sorts.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900665,"PostDate":1437150711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Skim thru here, it was a recent one where they are talking about apps and such!<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...e-ipod-hook-up\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also believe @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> spoke about her experiencing making playlists too - I think it was in her planning thread, but if not hopefully she can pop o