!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>YAHOO!! I'm sure it will be beautiful! I can't wait to see it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73d9cb5d523e74d65c4eb3384e2284a0","RawContent":"has anyone ordered from here:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.edressme.com\/\"&gt;Evening dresses, cocktail, prom dresses, gowns by eDressMe&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n prices look great, dresses look nice, and they say they have a store in NY","Attachments":[],"Id":942839,"PostDate":1259463761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                has anyone ordered from here:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.edressme.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Evening dresses, cocktail, prom dresses, gowns by eDressMe<\/a><br \/> <br \/> prices look great, dresses look nice, and they say they have a store in NY\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dglthibodeau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1250217210,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Puzzled-Bride","Id":220520,"Name":"Puzzled-Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b517f697204a267e337b448fccf9c884","RawContent":"You ladies have really sparked my fire now!! I kind of hate that I&#039;ve already ordered my wedding dress from a local shop! We&#039;re doing an AHR the week after the wedding (It&#039;s a DW) so I won&#039;t have NEARLY enough time to get my wedding dress cleaned. I kind of wanted to wear something bright and colorful to the AHR but now I don&#039;t know...perhaps I should take a look at some of short styles in white on Landy Bridal!","Attachments":[],"Id":944203,"PostDate":1259614319,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You ladies have really sparked my fire now!! I kind of hate that I've already ordered my wedding dress from a local shop! We're doing an AHR the week after the wedding (It's a DW) so I won't have NEARLY enough time to get my wedding dress cleaned. I kind of wanted to wear something bright and colorful to the AHR but now I don't know...perhaps I should take a look at some of short styles in white on Landy Bridal!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"famuivy54@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1256788493,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222930.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"latoya1908","Id":222930,"Name":"latoya1908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fb150c04d24a63fc9bd1580bb16f001","RawContent":"WOW! KJT1985 your dress is GORGEOUS!!! The beading is AMAZING! I have already purchased a dress from Davids Bridal, but seeing the fabulous results all you girlies on here have been getting I&#039;m thinking of selling it and buying a dress through one of the sites that has been discussed! My mom will probably kill me since she&#039;s the one who paid for the first one!! It&#039;s awful but since I got my DB gown I have seen and tried on others that I like WAAAAAY better LOL! I just wish I hadn&#039;t been so quick to get a dress.....I think it was just the excitement that got to me he he he!","Attachments":[],"Id":946582,"PostDate":1259723667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW! KJT1985 your dress is GORGEOUS!!! The beading is AMAZING! I have already purchased a dress from Davids Bridal, but seeing the fabulous results all you girlies on here have been getting I'm thinking of selling it and buying a dress through one of the sites that has been discussed! My mom will probably kill me since she's the one who paid for the first one!! It's awful but since I got my DB gown I have seen and tried on others that I like WAAAAAY better LOL! I just wish I hadn't been so quick to get a dress.....I think it was just the excitement that got to me he he he!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1580\/1768\/20110402\/we+tie+the+knot%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1580\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bpink62581@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1251134963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220888.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bpink62581","Id":220888,"Name":"Bpink62581","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"383c77ff7ca4948e64d58f14d658bcee","RawContent":"I GOT MY DRESS TODAY! I GOT MY DRESS TODAY!!! I&#039;m sooo ecstatic!! It&#039;s even better than the pictures! The beading is definitely darker\/shinier in person! I am astonished at the quality considering it cost me $180 (WITH shipping)!!!! I think it&#039;s better quality than Davids bridal dresses. We live in a state without friends or family (just moved this summer and I don&#039;t work with any girls). I put it on backwards, tied myself in as best I could, turned it around....just to find out the camera battery was dead. ARG!! Maybe tomorrow, the fiance is almost home!\n \n EmmaGaussoin did you get your proof pictures yet&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":947942,"PostDate":1259800639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I GOT MY DRESS TODAY! I GOT MY DRESS TODAY!!! I'm sooo ecstatic!! It's even better than the pictures! The beading is definitely darker\/shinier in person! I am astonished at the quality considering it cost me $180 (WITH shipping)!!!! I think it's better quality than Davids bridal dresses. We live in a state without friends or family (just moved this summer and I don't work with any girls). I put it on backwards, tied myself in as best I could, turned it around....just to find out the camera battery was dead. ARG!! Maybe tomorrow, the fiance is almost home!<br \/> <br \/> EmmaGaussoin did you get your proof pictures yet<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;0\/st\/20100223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/67d5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...67d5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"katie.torley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232061403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213991.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJT1985","Id":213991,"Name":"KJT1985","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"000b8b4d5a2e1f7a4fa3b743824d8bb5","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KJT1985&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I GOT MY DRESS TODAY! I GOT MY DRESS TODAY!!! I&#039;m sooo ecstatic!! It&#039;s even better than the pictures! The beading is definitely darker\/shinier in person! I am astonished at the quality considering it cost me $180 (WITH shipping)!!!! I think it&#039;s better quality than Davids bridal dresses. We live in a state without friends or family (just moved this summer and I don&#039;t work with any girls). I put it on backwards, tied myself in as best I could, turned it around....just to find out the camera battery was dead. ARG!! Maybe tomorrow, the fiance is almost home!\n \n EmmaGaussoin did you get your proof pictures yet&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n CONGRATS!!!!!!! Everyday I have been waking up early to check my email hoping my proofs will be there and their not! They told me 30-40 days and it has only been 35 but I want to see it! I am so happy that the quality is good. I can&#039;t wait to see mine! I promise I will post my proofs when I get them! Now go find a girl to help you get that dress on right! Can&#039;t wait to see pictures of you in it!","Attachments":[],"Id":947980,"PostDate":1259802626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KJT1985<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I GOT MY DRESS TODAY! I GOT MY DRESS TODAY!!! I'm sooo ecstatic!! It's even better than the pictures! The beading is definitely darker\/shinier in person! I am astonished at the quality considering it cost me $180 (WITH shipping)!!!! I think it's better quality than Davids bridal dresses. We live in a state without friends or family (just moved this summer and I don't work with any girls). I put it on backwards, tied myself in as best I could, turned it around....just to find out the camera battery was dead. ARG!! Maybe tomorrow, the fiance is almost home!<br \/> <br \/> EmmaGaussoin did you get your proof pictures yet<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> CONGRATS!!!!!!! Everyday I have been waking up early to check my email hoping my proofs will be there and their not! They told me 30-40 days and it has only been 35 but I want to see it! I am so happy that the quality is good. I can't wait to see mine! I promise I will post my proofs when I get them! Now go find a girl to help you get that dress on right! Can't wait to see pictures of you in it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"emmagaussoin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253827011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221980.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EmmaGaussoin","Id":221980,"Name":"EmmaGaussoin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04c429e3800d7682cd7e6448bfb3f031","RawContent":"This morning I took some pictures of the dress (now that I have a charged camera battery!) but didn&#039;t try it on again. 