{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f721d2797f51b209413efbe249566fa3","RawContent":"I haven&#039;t seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the &amp;quot;flow&amp;quot; would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough &amp;quot;beachy&amp;quot; for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don&#039;t have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same &amp;quot;grace&amp;quot;, what do you think?\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":981453,"PostDate":1262548744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the \"flow\" would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough \"beachy\" for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don't have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same \"grace\", what do you think?<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/8s45sraly5.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/8s45sraly5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"julie.mackay@polymtl.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262101300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224168.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ewok","Id":224168,"Name":"ewok","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f529107d0d576f645ffbc5a7aee0881","RawContent":"hello everyone. I have ordered a lace gown from them and I should be getting it at the end of this month.. so as soon as I receive it I will surely tell you and show you how it turns out! \n \n \n As far as the chiffon dress by Maggie, I&#039;m sure it would be pretty easy for them to duplicate. Good luck to all of you! I hope I love the dress when it gets here because I am out of time to order from a bridal store around me!","Attachments":[],"Id":982231,"PostDate":1262598312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hello everyone. I have ordered a lace gown from them and I should be getting it at the end of this month.. so as soon as I receive it I will surely tell you and show you how it turns out! <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> As far as the chiffon dress by Maggie, I'm sure it would be pretty easy for them to duplicate. Good luck to all of you! I hope I love the dress when it gets here because I am out of time to order from a bridal store around me!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megkisslinger@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1242966480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217732.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Islandbride2b","Id":217732,"Name":"Islandbride2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b550be3d2f093f9ffe5da4acdc26d745","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ewok&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I haven&#039;t seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the &amp;quot;flow&amp;quot; would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough &amp;quot;beachy&amp;quot; for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don&#039;t have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same &amp;quot;grace&amp;quot;, what do you think?\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;A girl on this site (RachelRaye-spelling could be wrong, but she has posted in this thread) had a Maggie dress replicated. It turned out beautifully. It was also chiffon. I believe she even had the dress up for sale on this site.\n \n Have you tried off the rack? Maybe a bridal store carries your size and you wouldn&#039;t have to alter it so it would be ready in time for your April wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":982408,"PostDate":1262624602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ewok<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I haven't seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the \"flow\" would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough \"beachy\" for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don't have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same \"grace\", what do you think?<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>A girl on this site (RachelRaye-spelling could be wrong, but she has posted in this thread) had a Maggie dress replicated. It turned out beautifully. It was also chiffon. I believe she even had the dress up for sale on this site.<br \/> <br \/> Have you tried off the rack? Maybe a bridal store carries your size and you wouldn't have to alter it so it would be ready in time for your April wedding.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melbc80@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253391218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221800.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meldal101010","Id":221800,"Name":"meldal101010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d37df1fbe8a26c4dbe43a483f846e269","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ewok&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I haven&#039;t seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the &amp;quot;flow&amp;quot; would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough &amp;quot;beachy&amp;quot; for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don&#039;t have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same &amp;quot;grace&amp;quot;, what do you think?\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Sorry...the spelling was wrong (RaychelRae)...Heres the link to her thread...\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/size-10-chiffon-wedding-gown-51280\/\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ng-gown-51280\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/size-10-chiffon-wedding-gown-51280\/\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ng-gown-51280\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":982431,"PostDate":1262625650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ewok<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I haven't seen lot chiffon dresses replicas, do you think the \"flow\" would be good? While I love traditional gowns, they are not enough \"beachy\" for me. Many of Maggie Destinations are made of chiffon, and I love how it floats around in the pics. I fell in love with this one ( SD5238 ). I could probably pay full retail (not so expensive), but I don't have the time, so my only choice is a replica. I just want it to have the same \"grace\", what do you think?<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_1_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.weddingshoppeinc.com\/Uploads\/Sized\/13295_2_262.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Sorry...the spelling was wrong (RaychelRae)...Heres the link to her thread...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/size-10-chiffon-wedding-gown-51280\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati....ng-gown-51280\/<\/a><a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/size-10-chiffon-wedding-gown-51280\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati....ng-gown-51280\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melbc80@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253391218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221800.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"meldal101010","Id":221800,"Name":"meldal101010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a48882805d0e6e9a339e9f07515dfea2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;meldal101010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;A girl on this site (RachelRaye-spelling could be wrong, but she has posted in this thread) had a Maggie dress replicated. It turned out beautifully. It was also chiffon. I believe she even had the dress up for sale on this site.\n \n Have you tried off the rack? Maybe a bridal store carries your size and you wouldn&#039;t have to alter it so it would be ready in time for your April wedding.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks, I&#039;ve checked Rachel&#039;s dress and it is pretty nice. Anyway, I don&#039;t know how I could be disappointed when I haven&#039;t even tried on one of those 1000$ dresses!\n \n And there are no bridal stores carrying Maggie Destination around here, I&#039;d have to drive down to the States 2h, or in another city 3 hours. Maybe I could just call them to see if I can at least try it on, but we have so much to do here right now (big DIY house reno), I just don&#039;t know... \n \n This is so much work. I thought you could just go and buy dresses off the rack!","Attachments":[],"Id":983264,"PostDate":1262659504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>meldal101010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">A girl on this site (RachelRaye-spelling could be wrong, but she has posted in this thread) had a Maggie dress replicated. It turned out beautifully. It was also chiffon. I believe she even had the dress up for sale on this site.<br \/> <br \/> Have you tried off the rack? Maybe a bridal store carries your size and you wouldn't have to alter it so it would be ready in time for your April wedding.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks, I've checked Rachel's dress and it is pretty nice. Anyway, I don't know how I could be disappointed when I haven't even tried on one of those 1000$ dresses!<br \/> <br \/> And there are no bridal stores carrying Maggie Destination around here, I'd have to drive down to the States 2h, or in another city 3 hours. Maybe I could just call them to see if I can at least try it on, but we have so much to do here right now (big DIY house reno), I just don't know... <br \/> <br \/> This is so much work. I thought you could just go and buy dresses off the rack!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/8s45sraly5.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/8s45sraly5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"julie.mackay@polymtl.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262101300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224168.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ewok","Id":224168,"Name":"ewok","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0c0364416d763ae6f8b2dc63ec8bb2e","RawContent":"Ladies, have to say that this thread is fantastic!!!\n I do have a dress already, but I&#039; thinking of selling it and getting one more, beachy, so to say from eBay!\n Always good to see the reviews!","Attachments":[],"Id":983335,"PostDate":1262661733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies, have to say that this thread is fantastic!!!<br \/> I do have a dress already, but I' thinking of selling it and getting one more, beachy, so to say from eBay!<br \/> Always good to see the reviews!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vovkina007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1262558709,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224281.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilRebel","Id":224281,"Name":"LilRebel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c60201b767d924983470fde3b9937b74","RawContent":"Ewok, none of the stores on Plaza St-Hubert carrie Maggie Destination? When I looked at the store locator of their website, they mentioned a few of those sores. Though they could be carrying just other collections by Maggie.","Attachments":[],"Id":983358,"PostDate":1262662331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ewok, none of the stores on Plaza St-Hubert carrie Maggie Destination? When I looked at the store locator of their website, they mentioned a few of those sores. Though they could be carrying just other collections by Maggie.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i24.photobucket.com\/albums\/c25\/coksy\/monogram6-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i24.photobucket.com\/albums\/c2...onogram6-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;105\/st\/20110505\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/1073\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1073\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ron.hufana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1256783540,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222928.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RonNMel","Id":222928,"Name":"RonNMel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"094061a425f288322ed358399d0a055a","RawContent":"Great thread.....I think I am going yto order a 2nd dress too","Attachments":[],"Id":983438,"PostDate":1262665220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great thread.....I think I am going yto order a 2nd dress too\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"simply_devine82@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1251390802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221035.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsAmErika","Id":221035,"Name":"MsAmErika","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4af23c66c10f63ac1d6b4af4bc62c279","RawContent":"I posted in here a while back about getting my replica dress. I was torn once I received it, but ended up wearing it on my wedding day. LOVED IT! I just got my pro pictures back (one is in my siggie). Ill try and post a link tomorrow so you can see an up close picture of it :) \n \n It was a replica of a sottero &amp;amp; midgley dress :)","Attachm