{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c1a92c6265a8778fa9a1d2daf30e45a","RawContent":"yes....received a quote this morning to make my dress\n \n Landybridal \u00a3198.00 duosheng \u00a3239.00\n \n Think im going with Landybridal, not because of the cost, but because of you ladies that have bought from them and posted pics are really happy with your dresses.....might I add you all look fantastic.\n \n The only dilemma i have is what size to order.....","Attachments":[],"Id":986458,"PostDate":1262856518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                yes....received a quote this morning to make my dress<br \/> <br \/> Landybridal \u00a3198.00 duosheng \u00a3239.00<br \/> <br \/> Think im going with Landybridal, not because of the cost, but because of you ladies that have bought from them and posted pics are really happy with your dresses.....might I add you all look fantastic.<br \/> <br \/> The only dilemma i have is what size to order.....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10704;116\/st\/20100531\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/5\/k\/add5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...add5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"samfrench34@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1249481202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220207.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":72,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sam33","Id":220207,"Name":"sam33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77bf9df064ec1a23e6aa673ef1eb70de","RawContent":"Sam33 Congrats on getting ready to order your dress.. as for size there are a lot of ladies on here who have ordered from Landy with their custom measurements, I on the other hand have ordered from the a regular size. IF you do a regular size, just remember that sizes over seas are a bit smaller\/tighter then sizes in the u.s. I was told that if you are a street size 10 you should order a 12. I do not know if this is true from experience but I will come the end of this month! :) NO worries though, so much easier to take a dress in then it is to let it out! \n \n I didn&#039;t do custom sizes because i have been losing weight pretty steady and didn&#039;t want the shape of the custom to look funny if I lost in areas harder to take in.. so I ordered a standard size to have altered closer to the end of April here in the states. \n \n \n best of luck to you and congrats on finding the dress you want for an awesome price!","Attachments":[],"Id":986461,"PostDate":1262858185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sam33 Congrats on getting ready to order your dress.. as for size there are a lot of ladies on here who have ordered from Landy with their custom measurements, I on the other hand have ordered from the a regular size. IF you do a regular size, just remember that sizes over seas are a bit smaller\/tighter then sizes in the u.s. I was told that if you are a street size 10 you should order a 12. I do not know if this is true from experience but I will come the end of this month! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> NO worries though, so much easier to take a dress in then it is to let it out! <br \/> <br \/> I didn't do custom sizes because i have been losing weight pretty steady and didn't want the shape of the custom to look funny if I lost in areas harder to take in.. so I ordered a standard size to have altered closer to the end of April here in the states. <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> best of luck to you and congrats on finding the dress you want for an awesome price!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megkisslinger@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1242966480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217732.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Islandbride2b","Id":217732,"Name":"Islandbride2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08351ad0404cb215317be83aedff9d97","RawContent":"I recently received my dress from Light in the Box. It was a knock off of a BCBG dress. I am going to attempt to post the pictures. Please let me know if you have any questions. I do not think it looks at all like the picture, but I LOVE it. \n First the picture from the website: \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dressample.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Now the one I received (needs to be pressed):\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":989213,"PostDate":1262999570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I recently received my dress from Light in the Box. It was a knock off of a BCBG dress. I am going to attempt to post the pictures. Please let me know if you have any questions. I do not think it looks at all like the picture, but I LOVE it. <br \/> First the picture from the website: <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dressample.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Now the one I received (needs to be pressed):<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v726\/EvilSkeleton\/dress2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msbaxter@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231276583,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213648.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mctilleys","Id":213648,"Name":"mctilleys","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"776a28afeec59a273a6fd630ac2380c4","RawContent":"Mctilleys- we can&#039;t see your pics!","Attachments":[],"Id":989215,"PostDate":1262999701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-famil