iv style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sammysgirl&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Jannae- I love the MAggie Sottero Reese dress...are you thinking of having it made??&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Yeah--- we are doing our TTD shoot several days before the wedding so of course I wouldn&#039;t use my dress. And since Reese was my first love, I thought it would be perfect.... So much beading though. And I wonder how it will hold up in the water?! (see through much?) hmmmm**Sigh.\n \n I will probably do it though. Just to see!!","Attachments":[],"Id":951321,"PostDate":1260000213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>sammysgirl<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Jannae- I love the MAggie Sottero Reese dress...are you thinking of having it made??<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Yeah--- we are doing our TTD shoot several days before the wedding so of course I wouldn't use my dress. And since Reese was my first love, I thought it would be perfect.... So much beading though. And I wonder how it will hold up in the water?! (see through much?) hmmmm**Sigh.<br \/> <br \/> I will probably do it though. Just to see!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married to my BEST FRIEND!<\/span><br><span>July 7, 2010!!My Planning Thread: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/lady-trunck-jannae-s-planning-post-tons-pics-60834\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ns-pics-60834\/<\/a><br><span>Non-Pro Pics:<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f55\/lady-truncks-jannaes-non-pro-pics-61751\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ro-pics-61751\/<\/a><br><span>Trash the dress!:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f55\/jannaes-trash-dress-session-fantasticial-cecilia-dumas-61397\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...a-dumas-61397\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jannae.ibarra@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.122.234.123","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1248069920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219601.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyTrunck","Id":219601,"Name":"LadyTrunck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e21eb707d96b66d707e861f3910f52fb","RawContent":"Hi,\n \n Has