 rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i802.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy309\/emmahackett\/IMG_0024.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i802.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy309\/emmahackett\/IMG_0026.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i802.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy309\/emmahackett\/IMG_0029.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I love the lace detail!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/s3.amazonaws.com\/wedding_prod\/photos\/902409730c42f3a4f10b8d267a70454f_s\">http:\/\/s3.amazonaws.com\/wedding_prod...8d267a70454f_s<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"raychelrae@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253395414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221802.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RaychelRae","Id":221802,"Name":"RaychelRae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d1899143d7082042756c9c0924f9523","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KittenHeart&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Alright ladies, after months of deliberation I finally ordered my dress from Duosheng. I&#039;ll keep you all posted on the results!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can&#039;t figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html\"&gt;http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html&lt;\/a&gt;) that I love, but don&#039;t even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":959155,"PostDate":1260488564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KittenHeart<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Alright ladies, after months of deliberation I finally ordered my dress from Duosheng. I'll keep you all posted on the results!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can't figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (<a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.duosheng....ihun\/2154a.html<\/a>) that I love, but don't even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Love is not about finding the right person, but creating a right relationship. It's not about how much love you have in the beginning but how much love you build till the end.<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrsrhbtobe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1236996522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215790.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsrhbtobe","Id":215790,"Name":"mrsrhbtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f6d3adc567f83dad0a3e384266aee51","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mrsrhbtobe&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can&#039;t figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html\"&gt;http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html&lt;\/a&gt;) that I love, but don&#039;t even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;You will have to email them to get the price for the dress - its not displayed on the website :)\n \n Nice dress choice! I can&#039;t wait to decide on a dress so I can order mine too!","Attachments":[],"Id":959417,"PostDate":1260501612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mrsrhbtobe<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can't figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (<a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.duosheng....ihun\/2154a.html<\/a>) that I love, but don't even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>You will have to email them to get the price for the dress - its not displayed on the website <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> Nice dress choice! I can't wait to decide on a dress so I can order mine too!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.olma@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249340110,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220135.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jo 2010","Id":220135,"Name":"Jo 2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2899429178d6084a9f39e40909f6625e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mrsrhbtobe&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can&#039;t figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html\"&gt;http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html&lt;\/a&gt;) that I love, but don&#039;t even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;OMG!!! This was my first dress choice! How funny, I think it&#039;s beautiful!\n \n All you do is email them and reference your dress designer and make to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:elegantweddinglimited@gmail.com\"&gt;elegantweddinglimited@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n They get back to you pretty quick and are good with emailing fast. They even got back to me and asked me to double check a few of my measurements.\n \n Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":959845,"PostDate":1260553037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mrsrhbtobe<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can't figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (<a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.duosheng....ihun\/2154a.html<\/a>) that I love, but don't even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>OMG!!! This was my first dress choice! How funny, I think it's beautiful!<br \/> <br \/> All you do is email them and reference your dress designer and make to <a href='mailto:elegantweddinglimited@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>elegantweddinglimited@gmail.com<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> They get back to you pretty quick and are good with emailing fast. They even got back to me and asked me to double check a few of my measurements.<br \/> <br \/> Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~ Mmm cupcakes ~<\/span><br \/>\n<span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;2\/st\/20100919\/e\/Our+Italian+Family+Recept\/dt\/-3\/k\/79dd\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...79dd\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"johnnygirl777@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1219259160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211300.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KittenHeart","Id":211300,"Name":"KittenHeart","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0cdd4ab9e54b964ac437bfc425d397a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mrsrhbtobe&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can&#039;t figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html\"&gt;http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html&lt;\/a&gt;) that I love, but don&#039;t even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I also found the dress on lightinthebox (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/A-line-Sweetheart-Chapel-Train-Satin-Tulle-Wedding-Dresses-for-Bride--HSX221-_p24587.html\"&gt;A-line Sweetheart Chapel Train Satin Tulle Wedding Dresses for Bride (HSX221) - US$ 129.99&lt;\/a&gt;) - they have it at $129.99. Should give you an idea! It&#039;s a pretty sweet price!","Attachments":[],"Id":960809,"PostDate":1260592871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mrsrhbtobe<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Congrats on ordering your dress!! I may just be super tired, but I can't figure out on the duosheng website how to order, or how much a dress even costs. I found one on there (<a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/2154a.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.duosheng....ihun\/2154a.html<\/a>) that I love, but don't even know how much it is! Any ideas? Thanks!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I also found the dress on lightinthebox (<a href='http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/A-line-Sweetheart-Chapel-Train-Satin-Tulle-Wedding-Dresses-for-Bride--HSX221-_p24587.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>A-line Sweetheart Chapel Train Satin Tulle Wedding Dresses for Bride (HSX221) - US$ 129.99<\/a>) - they have it at $129.99. Should give you an idea! It's a pretty sweet price!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fallen_666@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1254683887,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222293.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mlabbe","Id":222293,"Name":"mlabbe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f224c56bc31520ec13d83ac89d5ffb03","RawContent":"Wow this thread is AWESOME! Because I&#039;m doing a short dress I thought I&#039;d get something more casual so I ordered it off Ebay (it&#039;s a Betsey Johnson so definitely not an actual wedding dress), and I do love the dress (it was $100US w\/ shipping). But, after months of deliberation I decided I want something more formal and have decided to get something from overseas and get it custom-made. \n \n I have so much to think about!!\n \n Thanks for all these wonderful pictures and reviews, it really helped ease my mind about ordering. I can&#039;t wait to see more dresses, keep posting ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":967183,"PostDate":1261095176,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow this thread is AWESOME! Because I'm doing a short dress I thought I'd get something more casual so I ordered it off Ebay (it's a Betsey Johnson so definitely not an actual wedding dress), and I do love the dress (it was $100US w\/ shipping). But, after months of deliberation I decided I want something more formal and have decided to get something from overseas and get it custom-made. <br \/> <br \/> I have so much to think about!!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for all these wonderful pictures and reviews, it really helped ease my mind about ordering. I can't wait to see more dresses, keep posting ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/wuntm8.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/wuntm8.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jmilnetraining@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1260911149,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223938.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"moonpalacebride","Id":223938,"Name":"moonpalacebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbe50458c0d28a83e255b56cea092add","RawContent":"great thread ladies..super helpful..I have a dress already but would like to change into a short dress for the ceremony so I think I will check out these sites and see what i can get..I don&#039;t want to spend a lot of money on another dress ..had i seen this before i probably could have gotten my dress for less :) looking forward to seeing all of your dresses when they come in!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":974449,"PostDate":1261978577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                great thread ladies..super helpful..I have a dress already but would like to change into a short dress for the ceremony so I think I will check out these sites and see what i can get..I don't want to spend a lot of money on another dress ..had i seen this before i probably could have gotten my dress for less <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> looking forward to seeing all of your dresses when they come in!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christineduemig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245463522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218609.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bearbunny","Id":218609,"Name":"bearbunny","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77ca886017636757d452929e5e67bd3a","RawContent":"I&#039;m ordering my dress off of Ebay as well. Likely my bridesmaids will as well. I&#039;ve had good luck with Ebay overseas custom wedding dresses so I&#039;m not worried in the slightest. I was almost married about 5 yrs ago and ordered it online then as well. It came in and was absolutely as pictured and fit me perfectly! After that wedding never happened, I sold the dress on Ebay as well and another bride in Canada got to enjoy it instead :)","Attachments":[],"Id":974489,"PostDate":1261986370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm ordering my dress off of Ebay as well. Likely my bridesmaids will as well. I've had good luck with Ebay overseas custom wedding dresses so I'm not worried in the slightest. I was almost married about 5 yrs ago and ordered it online then as well. It came in and was absolutely as pictured and fit me perfectly! After that wedding never happened, I sold the dress on Ebay as well and another bride in Canada got to enjoy it instead <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>We're married!!<\/span><br><br><span>GBP AKUMAL\/COBA REVIEW<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/gbp-coba-akumal-review-26-04-2010-long-58822\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...10-long-58822\/<\/a><br><span>Some pics off Facebook!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?aid=431924&id=819340433&l=9600f65262\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?ai...3&l=9600f65262<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v688\/HereFishie\/RobandCheryl%20Wedding\/April%2021-May5\/DSC_0993-1.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v6...DSC_0993-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"herefishiefish@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1256774279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222922.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HereFishie","Id":222922,"Name":"HereFishie","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":350,"NextPage":360,"PreviousPage":340,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
