it on my wedding day. LOVED IT! I just got my pro pictures back (one is in my siggie). Ill try and post a link tomorrow so you can see an up close picture of it :) \n \n It was a replica of a sottero &amp;amp; midgley dress :)","Attachments":[],"Id":983450,"PostDate":1262665729,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I posted in here a while back about getting my replica dress. I was torn once I received it, but ended up wearing it on my wedding day. LOVED IT! I just got my pro pictures back (one is in my siggie). Ill try and post a link tomorrow so you can see an up close picture of it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> It was a replica of a sottero & midgley dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cajaya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1210010430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SgtPepperette","Id":209276,"Name":"SgtPepperette","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":370,"NextPage":380,"PreviousPage":360,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
