;I just got married at the Grand Sirenis Mayan Riviera this past April 2014.&amp;nbsp; Before going away I found some workout programs that have really helped me to tone up and lose all that extra weight.&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately, I didn&#039;t get down to my goal weight before going away.&amp;nbsp; Life happened, some very unexpected events happened just prior to the wedding and I went through a very rough patch.&amp;nbsp; This coming April will be my husband and I&#039;s (grammar sorry) 1st wedding anniversary.&amp;nbsp; I want to go away again to celebrate and I want to ROCK a bikini!!&amp;nbsp; And I&#039;m actually thinking of bringing my wedding dress with me to do a trash the dress photo shoot because we weren&#039;t able to afford it in April.&amp;nbsp; So long story short I want to help as many brides get to their goal weight as possible.&amp;nbsp; Please post if you are interested in getting fit and fabulous before the big day! :)&amp;nbsp; Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879210,"PostDate":1417037061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Guys,<\/p>\n<p>I just got married at the Grand Sirenis Mayan Riviera this past April 2014.\u00a0 Before going away I found some workout programs that have really helped me to tone up and lose all that extra weight.\u00a0 Unfortunately, I didn't get down to my goal weight before going away.\u00a0 Life happened, some very unexpected events happened just prior to the wedding and I went through a very rough patch.\u00a0 This coming April will be my husband and I's (grammar sorry) 1st wedding anniversary.\u00a0 I want to go away again to celebrate and I want to ROCK a bikini!!\u00a0 And I'm actually thinking of bringing my wedding dress with me to do a trash the dress photo shoot because we weren't able to afford it in April.\u00a0 So long story short I want to help as many brides get to their goal weight as possible.\u00a0 Please post if you are interested in getting fit and fabulous before the big day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Cheers!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaroach2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.207.113.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417035775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Loveweddings2014","Id":281256,"Name":"Loveweddings2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50a061e669387065249e87b6952848f1","RawContent":"I have my own regime but wanted to jump in and say I&#039;m\n\nGoing to be a GS bride in less than 2 months!!!! Would love to hear your experience :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879213,"PostDate":1417044296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have my own regime but wanted to jump in and say I'm<br>\nGoing to be a GS bride in less than 2 months!!!! Would love to hear your experience <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.207.113.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eeacd305229a644c020681493f0e3342","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879213\" timestamp=\"1417058696\"]\nI have my own regime but wanted to jump in and say I&#039;m\nGoing to be a GS bride in less than 2 months!!!! Would love to hear your experience :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapata[\/quote]We had a great time at the grand Sirenis.  If you are dealing with a specific wedding co-ordinator do not be surprised if when you get there you are dealing with someone else.  There are about 4 or 5 of them and it seemed like they all just jump in where they are needed.  As far as pricing.  Bring EVERYTHING that you have as far as documentation with you.  Every e-mail that you had.  Every single thing.  There were a few times where I had to pull out an e-mail and say \"uh no, this was supposed to be included in my package.\"  The actual wedding day, there is nothing to stress about.  They do weddings every single day.  AND THEY RUN ON MEXICAN TIME!  This means do not be surprised if your ceremony was to be at 3pm and it is 3:15 and no one has came to your room yet.  Our ceremony was at 4 and it was 4:15 before I even left the room.  Everything is beautiful though.  The food was excellent.  We got the palapa, and when we came in after getting pictures done everything was piping hot.  We had the mariachi band play as well and it was great!  Enjoy your day.  If you have any other questions let me know.  Congrats!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1879305,"PostDate":1417257929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 26 November 2014 - 11:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have my own regime but wanted to jump in and say I'm<br>\nGoing to be a GS bride in less than 2 months!!!! Would love to hear your experience <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapata<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>We had a great time at the grand Sirenis.\u00a0 If you are dealing with a specific wedding co-ordinator do not be surprised if when you get there you are dealing with someone else.\u00a0 There are about 4 or 5 of them and it seemed like they all just jump in where they are needed.\u00a0 As far as pricing.\u00a0 Bring EVERYTHING that you have as far as documentation with you.\u00a0 Every e-mail that you had.\u00a0 Every single thing.\u00a0 There were a few times where I had to pull out an e-mail and say \"uh no, this was supposed to be included in my package.\"\u00a0 The actual wedding day, there is nothing to stress about.\u00a0 They do weddings every single day.\u00a0 AND THEY RUN ON MEXICAN TIME!\u00a0 This means do not be surprised if your ceremony was to be at 3pm and it is 3:15 and no one has came to your room yet.\u00a0 Our ceremony was at 4 and it was 4:15 before I even left the room.\u00a0 Everything is beautiful though.\u00a0 The food was excellent.\u00a0 We got the palapa, and when we came in after getting pictures done everything was piping hot.\u00a0 We had the mariachi band play as well and it was great!\u00a0 Enjoy your day.\u00a0 If you have any other questions let me know.\u00a0 Congrats!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaroach2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.207.113.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417035775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Loveweddings2014","Id":281256,"Name":"Loveweddings2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6d6fc553270d9ed43568cc1cb7ee938","RawContent":"I have been using 21 day fix by beachbody. It&#039;s a 30 minute workout with a easy meal plan and I&#039;ve been seeing great results :) I hve also become a beachbody coach if you have any questions I&#039;d be more than happy to help","Attachments":[],"Id":1879324,"PostDate":1417284710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have been using 21 day fix by beachbody. It's a 30 minute workout with a easy meal plan and I've been seeing great results <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I hve also become a beachbody coach if you have any questions I'd be more than happy to help\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398815231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8974cf2a57892ce5d79cfd33e8a214cb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Loveweddings2014\" post=\"1879305\" timestamp=\"1417272329\"]\nWe had a great time at the grand Sirenis.  If you are dealing with a specific wedding co-ordinator do not be surprised if when you get there you are dealing with someone else.  There are about 4 or 5 of them and it seemed like they all just jump in where they are needed.  As far as pricing.  Bring EVERYTHING that you have as far as documentation with you.  Every e-mail that you had.  Every single thing.  There were a few times where I had to pull out an e-mail and say \"uh no, this was supposed to be included in my package.\"  The actual wedding day, there is nothing to stress about.  They do weddings every single day.  AND THEY RUN ON MEXICAN TIME!  This means do not be surprised if your ceremony was to be at 3pm and it is 3:15 and no one has came to your room yet.  Our ceremony was at 4 and it was 4:15 before I even left the room.  Everything is beautiful though.  The food was excellent.  We got the palapa, and when we came in after getting pictures done everything was piping hot.  We had the mariachi band play as well and it was great!  Enjoy your day.  If you have any other questions let me know.  Congrats!! :)[\/quote]\nThanks!\n\nI actually pushed my ceremony forward from 330pm to 300pm because I was worried we would start late and we wouldn&#039;t have enough time in the light for pics!\n\nThe big thing I am struggling with right now is the timing of the night -- I wanted to enjoy a tiny bit of the mariachi, then have them do cocktail hour, but I think most people do mariachi with cocktail hour combined.  So looking for opinions on that.  I also thought cocktail hour could be in the palapa but it&#039;s on the beach?  It&#039;s not a big deal, just assumed it would be in the palapa.\n\nDid you use the spa for hair and make up?\n\nThanks!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1879344,"PostDate":1417315890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Loveweddings2014, on 29 November 2014 - 10:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We had a great time at the grand Sirenis.\u00a0 If you are dealing with a specific wedding co-ordinator do not be surprised if when you get there you are dealing with someone else.\u00a0 There are about 4 or 5 of them and it seemed like they all just jump in where they are needed.\u00a0 As far as pricing.\u00a0 Bring EVERYTHING that you have as far as documentation with you.\u00a0 Every e-mail that you had.\u00a0 Every single thing.\u00a0 There were a few times where I had to pull out an e-mail and say \"uh no, this was supposed to be included in my package.\"\u00a0 The actual wedding day, there is nothing to stress about.\u00a0 They do weddings every single day.\u00a0 AND THEY RUN ON MEXICAN TIME!\u00a0 This means do not be surprised if your ceremony was to be at 3pm and it is 3:15 and no one has came to your room yet.\u00a0 Our ceremony was at 4 and it was 4:15 before I even left the room.\u00a0 Everything is beautiful though.\u00a0 The food was excellent.\u00a0 We got the palapa, and when we came in after getting pictures done everything was piping hot.\u00a0 We had the mariachi band play as well and it was great!\u00a0 Enjoy your day.\u00a0 If you have any other questions let me know.\u00a0 Congrats!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I actually pushed my ceremony forward from 330pm to 300pm because I was worried we would start late and we wouldn't have enough time in the light for pics!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The big thing I am struggling with right now is the timing of the night -- I wanted to enjoy a tiny bit of the mariachi, then have them do cocktail hour, but I think most people do mariachi with cocktail hour combined. \u00a0So looking for opinions on that. \u00a0I also thought cocktail hour could be in the palapa but it's on the beach? \u00a0It's not a big deal, just assumed it would be in the palapa.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you use the spa for hair and make up?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.207.113.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b16b1e653d0faa9fb90841b980f4384a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879344\" timestamp=\"1417330290\"]\nThanks!\n\nI actually pushed my ceremony forward from 330pm to 300pm because I was worried we would start late and we wouldn&#039;t have enough time in the light for pics!\n\nThe big thing I am struggling with right now is the timing of the night -- I wanted to enjoy a tiny bit of the mariachi, then have them do cocktail hour, but I think most people do mariachi with cocktail hour combined.  So looking for opinions on that.  I also thought cocktail hour could be in the palapa but it&#039;s on the beach?  It&#039;s not a big deal, just assumed it would be in the palapa.\n\nDid you use the spa for hair and make up?\n\nThanks!!![\/quote]So we had the wedding around 4:15 (it was short about 15 minutes long).  When the wedding was done they had an area all set up with the mariachi band, appetizers and champagne.  We chatted with guests for about 15 minutes.  The set up that they have is very impressive!   The food is laid out very elegantly!  You will not be disappointed.  The only thing I would suggest is if you have older guests maybe having a couple chairs brought for them to sit on.  Then I did some pictures with all the guests.  When it got to just wedding party\/bride and groom pics.  They shuttled all the other guests back to one of the restort bars where they could enjoy some drinks.  (I had beer brought to where we were getting the pics done for the wedding party, but it cost $ per drink.  I didn&#039;t think that was necessary since we were all already paying to drink but they were going to charge me and I wanted the money to go other places)  So when everyone else went to go drink.  We got the rest of our pics done.  Then my favourite part of the day we actually had time while everyone was arriving back and being seated in the palapa for us to sit on the beach.  Have a beer and just relax for a few minutes.  It was AMAZING!!!  Loved it!!\n\nThen when everyone was back they introduced us.  We did the speeches right away (we only had a few people speak so they were really quick)  And then ate and had the best party ever!!  I want to do it again!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1879726,"PostDate":1417718407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 30 November 2014 - 02:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I actually pushed my ceremony forward from 330pm to 300pm because I was worried we would start late and we wouldn't have enough time in the light for pics!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The big thing I am struggling with right now is the timing of the night -- I wanted to enjoy a tiny bit of the mariachi, then have them do cocktail hour, but I think most people do mariachi with cocktail hour combined. \u00a0So looking for opinions on that. \u00a0I also thought cocktail hour could be in the palapa but it's on the beach? \u00a0It's not a big deal, just assumed it would be in the palapa.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you use the spa for hair and make up?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>So we had the wedding around 4:15 (it was short about 15 minutes long).\u00a0 When the wedding was done they had an area all set up with the mariachi band, appetizers and champagne.\u00a0 We chatted with guests for about 15 minutes.\u00a0 The set up that they have is very impressive!\u00a0\u00a0 The food is laid out very elegantly!\u00a0 You will not be disappointed.\u00a0 The only thing I would suggest is if you have older guests maybe having a couple chairs brought for them to sit on.\u00a0 Then I did some pictures with all the guests.\u00a0 When it got to just wedding party\/bride and groom pics.\u00a0 They shuttled all the other guests back to one of the restort bars where they could enjoy some drinks.\u00a0 (I had beer brought to where we were getting the pics done for the wedding party, but it cost $ per drink.\u00a0 I didn't think that was necessary since we were all already paying to drink but they were going to charge me and I wanted the money to go other places)\u00a0 So when everyone else went to go drink.\u00a0 We got the rest of our pics done.\u00a0 Then my favourite part of the day we actually had time while everyone was arriving back and being seated in the palapa for us to sit on the beach.\u00a0 Have a beer and just relax for a few minutes.\u00a0 It was AMAZING!!!\u00a0 Loved it!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Then when everyone was back they introduced us.\u00a0 We did the speeches right away (we only had a few people speak so they were really quick)\u00a0 And then ate and had the best party ever!!\u00a0 I want to do it again!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaroach2014@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.207.113.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417035775,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Loveweddings2014","Id":281256,"Name":"Loveweddings2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76f3d329a68d7a099165956b0c8cd17b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Loveweddings2014\" post=\"1879726\" timestamp=\"1417732807\"]\nSo we had the wedding around 4:15 (it was short about 15 minutes long).  When the wedding was done they had an area all set up with the mariachi band, appetizers and champagne.  We chatted with guests for about 15 minutes.  The set up that they have is very impressive!   The food is laid out very elegantly!  You will not be disappointed.  The only thing I would suggest is if you have older guests maybe having a couple chairs brought for them to sit on.  Then I did some pictures with all the guests.  When it got to just wedding party\/bride and groom pics.  They shuttled all the other guests back to one of the restort bars where they could enjoy some drinks.  (I had beer brought to where we were getting the pics done for the wedding party, but it cost $ per drink.  I didn&#039;t think that was necessary since we were all already paying to drink but they were going to charge me and I wanted the money to go other places)  So when everyone else went to go drink.  We got the rest of our pics done.  Then my favourite part of the day we actually had time while everyone was arriving back and being seated in the palapa for us to sit on the beach.  Have a beer and just relax for a few minutes.  It was AMAZING!!!  Loved it!!\n\nThen when everyone was back they introduced us.  We did the speeches right away (we only had a few people speak so they were really quick)  And then ate and had the best party ever!!  I want to do it again!![\/quote]Thanks!! Sounds fantastic. \n\nI&#039;ve opted to have open bar at the beach and\/or palapa and not shuttle people. Don&#039;t want the hassle of people not making it back, etc :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nDid you use the spa?\n\nDid they steam your dress?\n\nHaha sorry!!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879727,"PostDate":1417719069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Loveweddings2014, on 04 December 2014 - 06:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So we had the wedding around 4:15 (it was short about 15 minutes long).  When the wedding was done they had an area all set up with the mariachi band, appetizers and champagne.  We chatted with guests for about 15 minutes.  The set up that they have is very impressive!   The food is laid out very elegantly!  You will not be disappointed.  The only thing I would suggest is if you have older guests maybe having a couple chairs brought for them to sit on.  Then I did some pictures with all the guests.  When it got to just wedding party\/bride and groom pics.  They shuttled all the other guests back to one of the restort bars where they could enjoy some drinks.  (I had beer brought to where we were getting the pics done for the wedding party, but it cost $ per drink.  I didn't think that was necessary since we were all already paying to drink but they were going to charge me and I wanted the money to go other places)  So when everyone else went to go drink.  We got the rest of our pics done.  Then my favourite part of the day we actually had time while everyone was arriving back and being seated in the palapa for us to sit on the beach.  Have a beer and just relax for a few minutes.  It was AMAZING!!!  Loved it!!<br><br>\nThen when everyone was back they introduced us.  We did the speeches right away (we only had a few people speak so they were really quick)  And then ate and had the best party ever!!  I want to do it again!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks!! Sounds fantastic. <br><br>\nI've opted to have open bar at the beach and\/or palapa and not shuttle people. Don't want the hassle of people not making it back, etc <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>Did you use the spa?<br><br>\nDid they steam your dress?<br><br>\nHaha sorry!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.96.89.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78424,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9331dfd9d5a303c6b3cf5c1067ed798f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Loveweddings2014\" post=\"1879210\" timestamp=\"1417051461\"]\nHey Guys,\nI just got married at the Grand Sirenis Mayan Riviera this past April 2014.  Before going away I found some workout programs that have really helped me to tone up and lose all that extra weight.  Unfortunately, I didn&#039;t get down to my goal weight before going away.  Life happened, some very unexpected events happened just prior to the wedding and I went through a very rough patch.  This coming April will be my husband and I&#039;s (grammar sorry) 1st wedding anniversary.  I want to go away again to celebrate and I want to ROCK a bikini!!  And I&#039;m actually thinking of bringing my wedding dress with me to do a trash the dress photo shoot because we weren&#039;t able to afford it in April.  So long story short I want to help as many brides get to their goal weight as possible.  Please post if you are interested in getting fit and fabulous before the big day! :)  Cheers![\/quote]\nHi,\n\nTechnology has changed over a period of time and there are many equipments now a days to loose weight and that to be without doing any exessive exercise. You can use CelluBlue to eliminate those extra fats from your body and specially from hips and thigh area. It is very easy to use, safe  and affordable. You can [url=\"http:\/\/cellublue.com\"]look here[\/url] for direction to use. I am definitely going to use it and lets hope for the best.","Attachments":[],"Id":1900753,"PostDate":1437357867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Loveweddings2014, on 26 November 2014 - 09:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey Guys,<\/p>\n<p>I just got married at the Grand Sirenis Mayan Riviera this past April 2014.\u00a0 Before going away I found some workout programs that have really helped me to tone up and lose all that extra weight.\u00a0 Unfortunately, I didn't get down to my goal weight before going away.\u00a0 Life happened, some very unexpected events happened just prior to the wedding and I went through a very rough patch.\u00a0 This coming April will be my husband and I's (grammar sorry) 1st wedding anniversary.\u00a0 I want to go away again to celebrate and I want to ROCK a bikini!!\u00a0 And I'm actually thinking of bringing my wedding dress with me to do a trash the dress photo shoot because we weren't able to afford it in April.\u00a0 So long story short I want to help as many brides get to their goal weight as possible.\u00a0 Please post if you are interested in getting fit and fabulous before the big day! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 Cheers!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Technology has changed over a period of time and there are many equipments now a days to loose weight and that to be without doing any exessive exercise. You can use CelluBlue to eliminate those extra fats from your body and specially from hips and thigh area. It is very easy to use, safe\u00a0 and affordable. You can <a href='http:\/\/cellublue.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>look here<\/a> for direction to use. I am definitely going to use it and lets hope for the best.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerrycruz55@outlook.com","IpAddress":"198.96.89.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437356456,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ClaudiaLewis","Id":284041,"Name":"ClaudiaLewis","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78424","Title":"Weight Loss For Hot Wedding Pics!","LastPostDate":1437357867},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
