  'forumId' => '14',
  'title' => 'Travel Agent/ Resort',
  'postContent' => 'Hello Everyone!

I\'ve been reading the forum for about a week and found that it\'s very helpful! I\'m newly engaged, it\'s been almost a month but I\'m totally lost! Not sure where to start. We are having a destination wedding in the Mexican Riviera Maya. I have looked at Moon Palace and found the rooms were too pricey for what I want my guests to spend on their stay. Should I go through a travel agent to negotiate room rates for me? And does anyone know any good travel agents in the San Antonio, TX area? Our priorities are the following:
Religious ceremony - need a chapel
Family friendly
All inclusive
Preferrably not Cancun
About 60 guests 
Want a reception on a sky terrace/rooftop
Affordable room rates

Any and all advice would be appreciated!!
',
